        <headline>Wind Advisory issued September 25 at 6:28AM PDT until September 25 at 5:00PM PDT by NWS Pendleton OR</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Southwest to west winds 20 to 35 mph with gusts of 40 to 50
mph expected.

* WHERE...Central Oregon.

* WHEN...Until 5 PM PDT this afternoon.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree
limbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.

* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Strongest winds are expected in the afternoon
and early evening.
</description>
        <instruction>Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.

Secure outdoor objects.</instruction>
